    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659870/extras/6d68bdb362d1dec74469ce602f557219.avif?t=1733989530\" width=624 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* All characters are 18 years old or above.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simulation Role-Playing Hentai Game With Epic and Storyline</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a1 System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659870/extras/b293f952dd2f694b5cb3223580820018.avif?t=1733989530\" width=500 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a role-playing simulation game with 42 maps including quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find special items and rare weapons or change classes to grow your army stronger to conquer the map with stronger enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play the game over and over with multiple difficulties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659870/extras/6a1ae9fa978c1765375e12b9ada6eebf.avif?t=1733989530\" width=500 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternate costumes are available for the seven female characters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sure they don't lose or get kidnapped in a battle, otherwise......</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story is consisted of two parts: &quot;Tales of Virginia War&quot; and &quot;Tales of Spirited Shrine.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The war started among humans, vampires, and werewolves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This adventure x comedy story will unfold the mystery of the main character's body and past of characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Synopsis</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prince Lane of Virginia was confused. His body was turning to that of somebody else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Kingdom of Virginia was enjoying a peace for long time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, the Kingdom is attacked by their long-time ally, the Kingdom of Stoalt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Virginians were overwhelmed by the massive army.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prince Lane fled to a village with his soldiers, but was ambushed by vampires there again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vampires are equipped with special skills and able to brainwash humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this crisis, a girl from an unknown tribe appears and fight against vampires.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lane leads his army to solve the mystery of his transformation and gets his Kingdom back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dialogues and messages can be skipped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- XXX Scenes Gallery is available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Alternate costumes are available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659870/extras/6d68bdb362d1dec74469ce602f557219.avif?t=1733989530\" width=624 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* All characters are 18 years old or above.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simulation Role-Playing Hentai Game With Epic and Storyline</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a1 System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659870/extras/b293f952dd2f694b5cb3223580820018.avif?t=1733989530\" width=500 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a role-playing simulation game with 42 maps including quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find special items and rare weapons or change classes to grow your army stronger to conquer the map with stronger enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play the game over and over with multiple difficulties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659870/extras/6a1ae9fa978c1765375e12b9ada6eebf.avif?t=1733989530\" width=500 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternate costumes are available for the seven female characters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sure they don't lose or get kidnapped in a battle, otherwise......</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story is consisted of two parts: &quot;Tales of Virginia War&quot; and &quot;Tales of Spirited Shrine.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The war started among humans, vampires, and werewolves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This adventure x comedy story will unfold the mystery of the main character's body and past of characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Synopsis</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prince Lane of Virginia was confused. His body was turning to that of somebody else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Kingdom of Virginia was enjoying a peace for long time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, the Kingdom is attacked by their long-time ally, the Kingdom of Stoalt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Virginians were overwhelmed by the massive army.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prince Lane fled to a village with his soldiers, but was ambushed by vampires there again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vampires are equipped with special skills and able to brainwash humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this crisis, a girl from an unknown tribe appears and fight against vampires.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lane leads his army to solve the mystery of his transformation and gets his Kingdom back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dialogues and messages can be skipped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- XXX Scenes Gallery is available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Alternate costumes are available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
